     ['“Let’s all help!”', '“Good try, team!”', '“What job can I do?”', '“Your idea is cool!”'],
     ['“Let’s split the work by what each of us is good at.”', '“Great effort — what can we fix next time?”', '“Who needs help with their part?”', '“Let’s hear everyone’s idea first.”'],
